{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>בגאות</b> — in the pride of the wicked." "<b>ידלק עני</b> — like ירדף (he pursues). And the sense: they seize the wicked — he being the one appointed, and his companions with him."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {1 "The antecedent of 'he' and the identity of 'the appointed one' are ambiguous in the Hebrew; translated hyper-literally."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:26:49.633551511Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}